index 0000000..172a8a2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/godot/audio/placeholder/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# Audio placeholder test tones
+
+These are synthesized test tones generated by `tools/make_test_tones.py`.
+They are **not** generated assets, composed music, or final production audio.
+
+| File | Duration | Frequency | Purpose |
+|------|----------|-----------|---------|
+| `jump.wav` | 80 ms | 900 Hz sine | Jump sound effect (looping disabled) |
+| `fail.wav` | 250 ms | 300 Hz sine | Death/fail sound effect (looping disabled) |
+| `music_loop.wav` | 4.000 s | 100 Hz sine | Background music stub (Forward loop) |
+
+All files: 44 100 Hz sample rate, 16-bit signed PCM, mono.
+
+`music_loop.wav` is sized to exactly two bars at 120 BPM (4.000 s).  The
+frequency (100 Hz, period = 441 samples) was chosen so that 400 complete
+cycles fit in the 176 400-sample file.  The mathematical waveform reaches a
+zero crossing at t = 0 and again at t = 4.000 s, giving a near-seamless
+Forward loop.  Actual audibility of the loop seam is a human check.
+
+Replace these files with real audio before shipping.
